           "shortComment": "Allen recorded five tackles (three solo) including 2.0 sacks during Monday's 31-10 loss at Kansas City.",
           "longComment": "Allen got off to a great start to the year in Week 1, recording multiple sacks in a game for his first time since 2024. The disruption he creates on the interior won't always show up in the box score, but he'll remain a big part of the defensive puzzle for Denver going into a Week 2 matchup versus the Jaguars."
