           "shortComment": "White reverted to the Raiders' practice squad Monday, per the NFL's official transaction log.",
           "longComment": "White was elevated to the active roster for a second straight week, and he was able to reel in a pair of touchdown catches during Sunday's 26-14 victory over the Chargers. The wide receiver has played 18 offensive snaps over two games with Las Vegas so far this year, and he'll likely be elevated again Week 3 versus the Saints."
