           "status": "Active",
           "date": "2026-09-13T19:20Z",
           "shortComment": "Brownlee (calf) has been cleared to return to Sunday's game against the Titans, Brian Costello of the New York Post reports.",
           "longComment": "Brownlee was carted from the sideline to the locker room after sustaining a calf injury. However, the third-year pro has cleared tests and been given the green light to return against the team that drafted him in the fifth round of the 2024 NFL Draft."
