           "shortComment": "The Eagles placed Dickerson (knee) on injured reserve Tuesday, Chris McPherson of the team's official site reports.",
           "longComment": "Dickerson injured his knee in the Eagles' 24-22 win over the Commanders last Sunday. The left guard will now need to miss at least four games before he can return to the active roster from IR. Willie Lampkin is set to be the starting left guard while Dickerson recovers."
