           "shortComment": "Cosmi suffered a concussion in Sunday's 37-20 loss to the Commanders, Nicki Jhabvala of The Athletic reports.",
           "longComment": "Cosmi has entered the NFL's five-step concussion protocol following Sunday's game. The starting right guard will need to progress through the protocol before being cleared for full contact by an independent neurologist. If Cosmi recovers quickly, the offensive lineman still has a chance to reach full participation in time to play next Sunday's game against the Seahawks."
