           "shortComment": "Luepke turned his only carry into a seven-yard gain during Sunday night's 28-20 loss to New York.",
           "longComment": "Luepke operated in his typical role as the team's starting fullback, seeing action for 15 of the team's 58 total offensive snaps. The 26-year-old also was on the field for nine snaps on special teams in contest. Luepke is a far more valuable real-life football player than he is a fantasy asset."
