           "status": "Active",
           "date": "2026-09-15T01:31Z",
           "shortComment": "Davis didn't have any output in the box score during the Jets' win over the Titans on Sunday.",
           "longComment": "Davis didn't see the field on offense with Breece Hall and Braelon Allen handling the workload at running back. The 2024 fifth-round pick did play 18 snaps on special teams and likely will continue to be limited to a similar role unless either Hall or Allen is forced to miss time."
