           "shortComment": "James (hand) is questionable to return to Sunday's contest against the Raiders.",
           "longComment": "James suffered a hand injury in the first quarter, and his status for the rest of the game is now up in the air. In James' absence, Tony Jefferson is a top candidate to see an increase in workload at safety."
