           "shortComment": "Stanley (toe) is questionable to return to Sunday's game against the Saints.",
           "longComment": "Stanley started Sunday's game after overcoming a persistent toe injury. The issue has flared up after some first-half snaps, and it is unclear if the left tackle will be able to return Sunday. Carson Vinson is the next man up at left tackle for the Ravens."
