           "shortComment": "Lindstrom (concussion) is active for Sunday's game against the Panthers.",
           "longComment": "Lindstrom was tagged as questionable for Sunday's NFC South tilt, and the veteran offensive lineman has been given the green light to play after passing the league's concussion protocol following an evaluation from an independent neurologist."
