           "shortComment": "Tranquill (back) did not appear on Kansas City's injury report Thursday.",
           "longComment": "The linebacker seems ready to play in the Chiefs' season opener against the Broncos on Monday night after missing time during training camp with back spasms. Tranquill recorded 103 tackles (55 solo), including 2.0 sacks, a pass breakup, a forced fumble and a fumble recovery during the 2025 regular season."
