           "shortComment": "Smith (hip) was a full participant in practice Thursday.",
           "longComment": "The right guard was dealing with a hip injury during training camp, though it was described even then as a short-term issue. Smith's availability for Week 1 was never really in doubt, and now that he's practicing ahead of Monday's matchup with Denver, he should be ready to play come game time."
