           "shortComment": "McDonald (ankle) is active for Sunday's Week 2 matchup against the Packers.",
           "longComment": "After limited practice sessions Thursday and Friday, McDonald, the only Jet whose status was in question this week, will get clearance to take the field. The one-time first-round pick was on the field for 50.0 percent of the team's snaps in Week 1 against Tennessee and managed to record 1.0 sacks, in addition to putting in some light work on special teams."
