           "shortComment": "Myers converted his lone field-goal attempts and made all four PATs in Sunday's 31-7 win over the Cardinals.",
           "longComment": "Myers' field goal was good from 33 yards in the third quarter. Through two games, he's a perfect 3-for-3 on field goals and has made all five extra-point tries. Following a tumultuous preseason, Myers appears to have put his struggles behind him. He'll be a back-end K1 for next Sunday's road date with the Commanders."
