           "date": "2026-09-17T19:53Z",
           "shortComment": "Richardson (groin) was a full participant at practice Thursday.",
           "longComment": "Richardson didn't practice Wednesday due to a groin injury but resumed practicing without limitations Thursday, suggesting the backup QB isn't in danger of missing Sunday night's game at Kansas City. Daniel Jones struggled in the Week 1 loss to the Ravens but remains locked in as the starter for the Colts."
