           "shortComment": "Thomas (groin) was a limited participant in Wednesday's practice,  Dan Salomone of the Giants' official site reports.",
           "longComment": "Thomas exited Monday's game in the fourth quarter with a groin injury. The adductor issue he suffered is not considered a serious injury, and the left tackle could play in Sunday's game against the Titans, Adam Schefter of ESPN reports. Thomas will probably spend the week as a limited practice participant before likely suiting up for Sunday's game to play through the injury."
