           "shortComment": "The Eagles signed Covey to the active roster Tuesday, Tim McManus of ESPN.com reports.",
           "longComment": "Covey returned four punts for 37 yards in Sunday's 24-22 win over the Commanders. The wide receiver's production on special teams has now earned him a spot on the 53-man roster. It remains to be seen if Covey has earned additional responsibilities for next Sunday's game against the Titans."
