           "shortComment": "Skule (oblique) was a full participant in Wednesday's practice.",
           "longComment": "Skule was inactive for the Buccaneers' 33-27 loss to the Bengals last Sunday due to an oblique injury. The offensive tackle has healed from the issue and is all set to log three consecutive full practices in the lead-up to next Sunday's game against the Browns."
