           "date": "2026-09-23T14:15Z",
           "shortComment": "Sykora (lower body) is expected to be out of action for 4-5 months, Colin Stephenson of Newsday reports Wednesday.",
           "longComment": "Based on his timeline, Sykora will almost certainly be designated for non-roster injured reserve to start the year and free up a roster spot for the Rangers. Prior to getting hurt, the 22-year-old winger was facing an uphill battle to make the Opening Night roster. Now, with his extended stint on the shelf, Sykora will almost certainly start in the minors once given the all-clear."
